<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Tobacco nine-month net profit up.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Tobacco nine-month net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Ceylon Tobacco Co Ltd for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>		     9 months 1996	 9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	  12,949.23   vs	11,940.39</p>
<p>    Net profit	   370.53   vs	   305.59</p>
<p>    Tax provision	199.22   vs	   209.74</p>
<p>NOTE - Ceylon Tobacco Co is Sri Lanka's monopoly cigarette maker. It is a unit of B.A.T Industries Plc.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
